{"step_index":474,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T09:21:36Z","input_tokens":3610,"cache_read_tokens":232233,"output_tokens":12760,"thinking":"Applying remaining edits and initiating a wait command. Reviewing changes to ensure accuracy before execution.\n\n\nThe halftone texture now has a full 0.06 to 0.94 range, allowing more nuanced rendering. A crisp diagonal portal effect is integrated with variable opacity across specific frames. The cryptomatte depth pass is consistently set to six across the relevant scripts to reduce depth artifacts.\n\nGlare threshold and strength are adjusted to minimize highlight clipping in the source imagery. Kuwahara filtering parameters, including size and mix, are now dynamic across the three acts, preserving car mattes.\n\n\nInitial color grading updates focused on distinct visual identities for each act, transitioning from warm tones in Act I to airy watercolor effects in Act II and aggressive crimson in Act III. Ink mask adjustments refine the background and car details, increasing contrast and pop ratio. Finally, the halftone factor and midtone band are adjusted across the acts.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v6_sv_comp.py","Replacement":"def build_packed_halftone_7px(name=\"SV_Halftone7px\", w=1920, h=1080, pitch_px=8.0):\n    \"\"\"1920x1080 旋转 22.5° 的 8.0px 高对比 Ben-Day 半调圆网点屏幕纹理（0.06..0.94 全动态范围）\"\"\"\n    yg, xg = np.mgrid[0:h, 0:w].astype(np.float32)\n    ca, sa = cos(radians(22.5)), sin(radians(22.5))\n    u = (xg * ca - yg * sa) / pitch_px\n    v = (xg * sa + yg * ca) / pitch_px\n    du = u - np.round(u)\n    dv = v - np.round(v)\n    dist = np.hypot(du, dv)\n    dots = np.clip(1.0 - (dist / 0.44) ** 2.1, 0.0, 1.0)\n    tex = 0.06 + 0.88 * dots\n    rgba = np.ones((h, w, 4), dtype=np.float32)\n    rgba[..., 0] = tex\n    rgba[..., 1] = tex\n    rgba[..., 2] = tex\n    return _save_and_load_mask_png(name, rgba)\n\n\ndef build_portal_slash_tear(name=\"SV_PortalSlashTear\", w=1920, h=1080):\n    \"\"\"次元穿越帧斜切漫画分镜裂缝与红青黄故障碎块叠加层 (f=426..429, f=893..896)\"\"\"\n    yg, xg = np.mgrid[0:h, 0:w].astype(np.float32)\n    nx = xg / max(1.0, w - 1.0)\n    ny = yg / max(1.0, h - 1.0)\n    # 主斜切漫画白边黑沟裂口 + 锯齿闪电折线\n    jag = 0.018 * np.sin(ny * 47.0) + 0.009 * np.cos(ny * 113.0)\n    d1 = np.abs((nx - 0.52) + (ny - 0.50) * 0.62 + jag)\n    d2 = np.abs((nx - 0.24) - (ny - 0.50) * 0.48 - jag * 0.8)\n    rgba = np.zeros((h, w, 4), dtype=np.float32)\n    # 电光青 / 品红 / 明黄次元裂口辉光带\n    cyan_band = (d1 < 0.026) & (d1 >= 0.011)\n    mag_band = (d2 < 0.022) & (d2 >= 0.009)\n    white_core = (d1 < 0.006) | (d2 < 0.005)\n    ink_edge = ((d1 >= 0.006) & (d1 < 0.011)) | ((d2 >= 0.005) & (d2 < 0.009))\n    rgba[cyan_band] = (0.05, 0.96, 1.0, 0.88)\n    rgba[mag_band] = (1.0, 0.08, 0.52, 0.88)\n    rgba[ink_edge] = (0.01, 0.01, 0.02, 0.96)\n    rgba[white_core] = (1.0, 0.96, 0.28, 1.0)\n    return _save_and_load_mask_png(name, rgba)","Target":"def build_packed_halftone_7px(name=\"SV_Halftone7px\", w=1920, h=1080, pitch_px=7.5):\n    \"\"\"1920x1080 旋转 22.5° 的 7.5px 清晰 Ben-Day 半调圆网点屏幕纹理（保存为真实 PNG 零内存泄露）\"\"\"\n    yg, xg = np.mgrid[0:h, 0:w].astype(np.float32)\n    ca, sa = cos(radians(22.5)), sin(radians(22.5))\n    u = (xg * ca - yg * sa) / pitch_px\n    v = (xg * sa + yg * ca) / pitch_px\n    du = u - np.round(u)\n    dv = v - np.round(v)\n    dist = np.hypot(du, dv)\n    dots = np.clip(1.0 - (dist / 0.42) ** 2.2, 0.0, 1.0)\n    tex = 0.34 + 0.34 * dots\n    rgba = np.ones((h, w, 4), dtype=np.float32)\n    rgba[..., 0] = tex\n    rgba[..., 1] = tex\n    rgba[..., 2] = tex\n    return _save_and_load_mask_png(name, rgba)"}},{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v6_sv_comp.py","Replacement":"sl_img = build_packed_speedlines()\nht_img = build_packed_halftone_7px()\nportal_img = build_portal_slash_tear()\ncs_img = build_packed_cinemascope_mask()\npaper_img = get